> Tip: When the limit is reached, booking and pickup emails (the confirmation, the agreement and signing links, pickup details, the handover, payment links and signing codes) go by text on their own, once each. Sign-in then opens on the phone option, and signing codes are offered by text first. Turn it off in **Settings** > **Site settings**, Email limit.

